privacy.aiMessage:
Recipient: {recipient}

AI features send your prompts, selected text, relevant document content, conversation history and API credentials to the model provider or gateway you configured. This includes automatic writing suggestions when enabled. The provider processes data under its own privacy policy.

Allow AI data sharing with this recipient? You can withdraw consent in Settings. Local editing works without consent.

privacy.aiImageMessage:
Recipient: {recipient}

Mark2 will send the current image, your question, relevant conversation history, and the connection credentials to this AI service. The service handles that data under its own privacy policy.

Allow image sharing with this service? You can withdraw permission in Settings.
